The online portal has been opened and the card UI has been optimized!

		[h2]Changelog[/h2]

		[h3]New Content[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] Added Guardian Shield;
		[*] Opened online portal;
		[/list]

		[h3]Fix Problem[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] Fixed the issue where the initial movement speed was not set correctly when starting the game;
		[/list]

		[h3]Other Adjustment[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] Adjust the initial contract effect to make it more consistent with the difficulty of teammates;
		[*] Add a halo to indicate whether the enemy is an elite monster, a small boss, or a boss;
		[*] Add a main card label to identify the main types: weapons, skill props, props, abilities, contracts, etc.;
		[/list]

The New Product Festival update is now online, enjoy it! Optimize performance, optimize monster groups, and greatly improve the gaming experience!

		[h2]Changelog[/h2]

		[h3]special statement[/h3]
		- Due to 'Zerg' being a trademarked term, we have decided to replace 'Zerg' in the game title with 'Swarm' to ensure compliance and respect for the associated intellectual property.Attention: Save data will be reset after this update!
		- Due to the limited energy of the development team, the online portal will be temporarily closed to focus on optimizing the game content. The online portal will be opened at an appropriate time based on the game operation situation.

		[h3]New Content[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] Added damage statistics function (single stage);
		[*] Added special monster groups;
		[*] Added battle settlement interface;
		[*] Added game illustrations;
		[*] Added main gun and secondary gun stunts;
		[*] Added a color to display the level of placed items;
		[*] Added a button to reduce the probability of appearance;
		[/list]

		[h3]Fix Problem[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] Fixed the problem of abnormal timer under special circumstances;
		[*] Fixed the problem of abnormal display after retry;
		[*] Fixed the problem of abnormal performance of ice skills under special circumstances;
		[*] Fixed the problem of abnormal performance of laser skills under special circumstances;
		[*] Fixed the problem of knockback direction;
		[*] Fixed the problem of international text;
		[*] Fixed the problem of the position of the wings of the Agility Lord;
		[*] Fixed the problem of energy sword;
		[*] Fixed the problem that the supply enhancement of the adventure* did not take effect correctly;
		[*] Fixed the problem that the locked items were not saved correctly after the adventure;
		[*] Fixed the problem that the upgrade was not correctly recorded in the archive;
		[*] Fixed the problem of weapon direction aiming;
		[*] Fixed the problem that extra .0 appeared in the text display;
		[*] Fixed the problem of contract ability display;
		[/list]

		[h3]Other Adjustment[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] Performance optimization!
		[*] Adjust vibration effects;
		[*] Removed poorly performing luck items;
		[*] Adjusted enemy health;
		[*] Adjusted the monster groups in endless mode;
		[*] Increased contract point rewards for treasures;
		[*] Increased the rewards for adventures, and changed the ability and item acquisition to 3-choice acquisition;
		[*] The store was changed from entering after each node to entering before each battle;
		[*] Adjusted the contract point drop rate of tier 1 and 2 enemies;
		[*] Adjusted the enemy values ​​of stages 4 to 7; Fixed adventure-related issues;
		[*] Adjusted some item values;
		[*] Adjusted the victory/failure interface;
		[*] No floating text is displayed when the enemy recovers health;
		[*] Adjusted the size of the encirclement;
		[*] Adjust the map boundary occlusion;
		[*] Adjust the sound effects;
		[*] Adjust the stage difficulty. Starting from the 7th stage, the difficulty will increase (the enemy's health will increase more);
		[*] Adjust the attribute rune effect to fixed damage;
		[*] The money bag no longer increases the experience value;
		[*] Close the online entrance;
		[*] Adjust the numerical display;
		[/list]

Added multi-route roadmap gameplay, new enemy lineups, and crafting optimization features! Next up: game performance improvements for a smoother experience!

		[h2]Changelog[/h2]

		[h3]Fix Problem[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] Fixed the problem of prop attributes;
		[*] Fixed the problem of internationalization;
		[*] Fixed the problem that the Laser Destroyer Contract was not displayed and effective normally;
		[*] Fixed the problem that the number of upgrades was not correctly recorded in the archive;
		[*] Fixed the problem of roadmap switching;
		[/list]

		[h3]Other Adjustment[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] Reduced enemy health;
		[*] Significantly improved game performance!
		[/list]

A lot of new skills and props have been added! Added prop smelting, which can smelt props marked as smeltable.

		[h2]Changelog[/h2]

		[h3]New Content[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] Added fire ball series, ice spike series, thunder ball series, poison bite series, and laser bullet series skill props;
		[*] Newly added props: irregular mechanical components, cold energy alloys, mechanical protection components, scalding kettles, blazing alloys, conductive metal, electric stone, strange ornament, deadly toxic liquid, poisonous pumpkin, cursed mask, cursed pendant, mystic ring, mirror alloy, laser prism, ancient beast tooth chain, fragment of the sword, swordmaster's cloak;
		[*] Added prop smelting mechanism;
		[/list]

		[h3]Fix Problem[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] Fixed some border bugs;
		[/list]

		[h3]Other Adjustment[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] Adjust some ability texts;
		[*] Adjust the effects of deep sea metal, red sunflower, ancient war drum, meteorite ore, item charging, and trigger mutation;
		[*] The effect of venomous bolt stacked to the maximum number of layers is changed to poison explosion;
		[/list]

The new character Sword Casket is now online! Next we will add more skills and enemies, so stay tuned!

		[h2]Changelog[/h2]

		[h3]New Content[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] Added Sword Casket, sword weapons, swordsmanship, and swordsmanship mastery, including 20+ new props/abilities!
		[*] 10+ synthesis recipes related to the sword series!
		[/list]

		[h3]Fix Problem[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] Fixed the problem that when having Eternal Flame, the damage was not cloned correctly, causing the damage to be infinitely superimposed;
		[/list]

		[h3]Other Adjustment[/h3]

		[list]
		[*] The character has added movement speed growth; health value growth has been changed to a fixed bonus;
		[*] Improve the burning damage increased by Eternal Flame;
		[*] Increase the attack range of missile series weapons;
		[*] Increase the range and duration of poisonous fog;
		[*] Added refresh correlation of low blood and shield series abilities;
		[*] After each stage ends, the refresh fee is reduced by one;
		[*] The earliest wave of coupon refresh is changed to 10;
		[*] Optimize the ability refresh logic to ensure that the abilities that appear are more reasonable;
		[*] Optimize the recommendation logic of capability selection;
		[*] Adjust the enemy’s HP growth;
		[*] Change the value of the enemy's health recovery skill from a percentage to a fixed value;
		[*] Adjust the attack logic of some enemies;
		[*] Adjust the difference between the 20th wave of easy, normal and hard difficulty, and lower the difficulty of the 20th wave of easy and normal difficulty;
		[*] Lower the difficulty of wave 40 of endless mode;
		[/list]

